- Fast: espresso, a sandwich, the subway
- Cheap: instant noodles, a library book, the bus
- Good: a slow roast, a letter by hand, a long walk
- Fast & Cheap: a slice, the dollar van
- Cheap & Good: home cooking, a park bench
- Fast & Good: a great takeaway, the express train
